<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>Credentials come from the _ODataAuth custom function, which should read</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>them from a server-hosted account -- never inline them in a script that</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>ships on a field device.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA["https://gr.cranstonhost.com/fmi/odata/v4/" & Case ( inSandbox ; "GSR_Gaskets Rock_Sandbox" ; "GSR_Gaskets Rock" ) & "/"]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$base</Name></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA["--X GET
--H \"Accept: application/json\"
--H \"OData-Version: 4.0\"
--H \"OData-MaxVersion: 4.0\"
--H \"Authorization: Basic " & _ODataAuth ( ) & "\"
--location
--dump-header $headerResponse
"]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$curl</Name></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>----------GUARD: CREDENTIALS---------- #</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>_ODataAuth reads the Credential table, which is record data loaded into</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>the master copy before distribution -- deliberately not schema, so it never</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>appears in a DDR export. An unconfigured copy would otherwise fail with a</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>401 that looks like a server problem.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="68" name="If"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Calculation><![CDATA[IsEmpty ( _ODataAuth ( ) )]]></Calculation></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA["This copy has no server credentials. It was distributed without them -- ask the office for a configured copy."]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$error</Name></Step>
